{"version":1,"content":"<p>跨境業務跑得穩不穩，晚高峯和流量洪峯説了算。對於出海企業、金融交易、直播音視頻及高並發應用而言，一旦遇到跨境鏈路擁塞、移動端丟包或突發性DDoS攻擊，輕則影響轉化率，重則導致業務中斷。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587822.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T08:24:00.445197+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T07:58:58+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:15.552671+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T08:17:15.552671+00:00","content_hash":"ea881f596cf397bb7ab29b853f3fd33754ffa6765eb9f61465aea014e3b4d0f9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}